# Shell scripts must stay LF everywhere. The punch pipeline's run_pipeline.sh and
# smoke_test.sh execute inside the Cowork Linux VM under dash, which aborts on CRLF
# line endings; with core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout would otherwise rewrite
# them to CRLF. (Hooks no longer ship .sh halves; they run on the Windows host.)
*.sh text eol=lf
